sequenceDiagram
    participant User as POI Admin (Browser)
    participant SP as SelectPlan page
    participant CO as Checkout page
    participant SA as SetupAccount page
    participant DB as AppDbContext (SQL Server)

    User->>SP: GET /Account/Register/SelectPlan

    SP->>DB: SELECT PaymentPackages WHERE IsActive=true AND TargetType='Admin' ORDER BY Price
    DB-->>SP: List<PaymentPackage>
    SP-->>User: Show plan cards (with DefaultPoiPriority per plan)

    User->>SP: POST (SelectedPackageId = "pro")
    SP->>DB: SELECT PaymentPackage WHERE Id='pro' AND IsActive=true
    DB-->>SP: package

    SP->>DB: INSERT PoiRegistrationRequest {PackageId='pro', Status='AwaitingPayment', ExpiresAtUtc=now+30min}
    DB-->>SP: OK

    SP-->>User: Redirect -> /Account/Register/Checkout?regId={guid}

    User->>CO: GET /Account/Register/Checkout?regId={guid}
    CO->>DB: SELECT PoiRegistrationRequest WHERE Id=guid AND Status='AwaitingPayment' AND ExpiresAtUtc>now
    DB-->>CO: registration

    User->>CO: POST (mock payment confirmed)
    CO->>DB: UPDATE PoiRegistrationRequest SET Status='PendingSetup', PaidAtUtc=now, PaymentReference='REF-xxx'
    DB-->>CO: OK

    CO-->>User: Redirect -> /Account/Register/SetupAccount?regId={guid}

    User->>SA: GET /Account/Register/SetupAccount?regId={guid}
    SA->>DB: SELECT PoiRegistrationRequest + Package WHERE Status='PendingSetup' AND ExpiresAtUtc>now
    DB-->>SA: registration with Package

    User->>SA: POST (Username, DisplayName, Password, ConfirmPassword)
    SA->>SA: Validate model, check Password == ConfirmPassword

    SA->>DB: SELECT AuthUserAccounts WHERE Username=normalizedUsername
    DB-->>SA: exists? false

    SA->>DB: INSERT AuthUserAccount {Username, Password, DisplayName, Role='PoiAdmin', IsActive=true}

    note over SA: DefaultPoiPriority from Package for new POI
    SA->>DB: INSERT UserSubscription {AuthUserId=newAccount.Id, PackageId, Status='Active', StartsAtUtc=now, ExpiresAtUtc=now+package.DurationDays, PaidAmount=package.Price}

    SA->>DB: UPDATE PoiRegistrationRequest SET Status='Completed', CreatedUsername=username
    DB-->>SA: SaveChanges OK

    SA->>SA: SignInAsync (Cookie auth) with claims
    SA-->>User: Redirect -> /Shop/Index
